ng>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nBecause of the recent acnes on her skin, Mary's roommate talks to her about how she has no confidence because of her appearance\n\n## Question \nIn this scenario, what is the most effective Response for Mary?\n\n## Choices\nA) \"I think you need to take better care of your skin\"\nB) \"Your value is not defined by how clear and flawless your skin is. Work on your personality\"\nC) \"I am sorry to hear that. I like you because of your personality, not your skin, but not all people are the same\"\nD) \"I can share my skincare tips with you to help with the acne\"","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.012431650075677585,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0d49aa9dc5a833d9125","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482388304,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"0e31798db7514e1cac471692031e5a01"}